{
 "cells": [
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "# Baxter, dual Baxter, QQ and Wronskian checks for a general gl(3) rep (new conventions)\n\nThe adjoint version is in `Companion-B-C-diagonalize.wb`, cells 30–44. Here every object takes the rep `lam` as an argument, so any $[\\lambda_1,\\lambda_2,\\lambda_3]$ can be run. The model is one site, $L=1$.\n\n- **Lax and twist.** $\\mathcal L_{ij}(u)=u\\delta_{ij}+hE_{ij}$, with companion twist $G$ acting on the right.\n- **Quantum minors.** Column $k$ is evaluated at $u-(k-1)h$.\n- **Factors.** $\\nu_n(u)=u-\\theta+h\\lambda_n$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Setup",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* GT machinery, verbatim from Companion-B-C-diagonalize.wb *)\nps[rep_] := ps[rep] = Block[{res = (Prepend[rep, #1] &) /@ Tuples[Table[Range[rep[[1, i + 1]], rep[[1, i]]], {i, 1, Length[rep[[1]]] - 1}]]}, If[Length[res[[1, 1]]] == 1, Reverse[Sort[res]], Reverse[Sort[Flatten[ps /@ res, 1]]]]];\ndim[rep_] := dim[rep] = Length[ps[{rep}]];\nJ0[k_][pat_] := J0[k][pat] = Sum[pat[[k, i]], {i, 1, k}] - Sum[pat[[k - 1, i]], {i, 1, k - 1}];\nJp[k_][pat_] := Jp[k][pat] = -Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k + 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k + 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] + 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJm[k_][pat_] := Jm[k][pat] = Sum[(Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k - 1, j]] + j, {j, Range[k - 1]}]/Product[pat[[k, i]] - i - pat[[k, j]] + j, {j, Complement[Range[k], {i}]}])*v[ReplacePart[pat, {k, i} -> pat[[k, i]] - 1]], {i, 1, k}];\nJJ[k_, l_, rep_] := JJ[k, l, rep] = Which[\n  k == l, DiagonalMatrix[J0[k] /@ ps[{rep}]],\n  l == k + 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jp[k][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l == k - 1, Transpose[Table[(Coefficient[Jm[l][ps[{rep}][[i]]], v[#1]] &) /@ ps[{rep}], {i, 1, Length[ps[{rep}]]}]],\n  l > k + 1, JJ[k, k + 1, rep] . JJ[k + 1, l, rep] - JJ[k + 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k + 1, rep],\n  l < k - 1, JJ[k, k - 1, rep] . JJ[k - 1, l, rep] - JJ[k - 1, l, rep] . JJ[k, k - 1, rep]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* rep-parametrized Lax, companion twist, twisted quantum minors and transfer matrices; names prefixed gb to avoid clashing with the adjoint notebook *)\nClearAll[gbE, gbL, gbTG, gbQMG, gbtG, gbν];\ngbχ = {z[1] + z[2] + z[3], z[1] z[2] + z[1] z[3] + z[2] z[3], z[1] z[2] z[3]};\ngbG = {{gbχ[[1]], -gbχ[[2]], gbχ[[3]]}, {1, 0, 0}, {0, 1, 0}};\ngbE[lam_][i_, j_] := gbE[lam][i, j] = JJ[i, j, lam];\ngbL[lam_][i_, j_][u_] := u IdentityMatrix[dim[lam]] KroneckerDelta[i, j] + h gbE[lam][i, j];\ngbTG[lam_][i_, j_][u_] := Sum[gbL[lam][i, k][u - θ[1]] gbG[[k, j]], {k, 3}];\n(* rows antisymmetrized, column k at u-(k-1)h *)\ngbQMG[lam_][Ii_, Jj_][u_] := Sum[Signature[σ] Dot @@ Table[gbTG[lam][σ[[k]], Jj[[k]]][u - (k - 1) h], {k, Length[Jj]}], {σ, Permutations[Ii]}];\ngbtG[lam_][a_][u_] := Sum[gbQMG[lam][Ii, Ii][u], {Ii, Subsets[Range[3], {a}]}];\ngbν[lam_][n_][u_] := u - θ[1] + h lam[[n]];",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "(* sanity check against the adjoint result: tG3 = χ3 ν1(u)ν2(u-h)ν3(u-2h) times identity.\n   gbLam is the rep for the whole notebook: change it and re-run cells 5-16 (gbOrthAll keeps one row per rep). *)\ngbLam = {2, 1, 1};\nWith[{t3 = Expand[gbtG[gbLam][3][u]]}, ToString[{dim[gbLam], Union[Flatten[Expand[t3 - gbχ[[3]] gbν[gbLam][1][u] gbν[gbLam][2][u - h] gbν[gbLam][3][u - 2 h] IdentityMatrix[dim[gbLam]]]]]}, InputForm]]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"49\" data-out-n=\"337\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"4\" data-sub-start=\"3\" data-sub-end=\"3\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[337]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7XHszLCBcezBcfVx9fQ==\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">{3, {0}}</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[337]= \\text{\\{3, \\{0\\}\\}}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "0e7df664-ed21-47f4-8009-1965fec474fd"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Eigenvalues at a numeric point\nThe point is $h=1$, $\\theta=1/3$, $z=(5/2,7/3,3/5)$, so $\\chi_3=7/2$, which is not unimodular. Each state's weight is read off from $t_1(\\theta)=h\\sum_iz_i\\mu_i$ in the twist-diagonal frame, matched against the GT weights of the rep.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "gbPt = {h -> 1, θ[1] -> 1/3, z[1] -> 5/2, z[2] -> 7/3, z[3] -> 3/5};\ngbPrec = 60;\ngbZ = Table[z[i] /. gbPt, {i, 3}];\ngbTn = Table[Expand[gbtG[gbLam][a][u] /. gbPt], {a, 3}];\n(* t1 is degenerate on repeated weights, so diagonalize a generic t1/t2 combination *)\ngbVec = Eigenvectors[N[(gbTn[[1]] + Pi gbTn[[2]]) /. u -> 3/7, gbPrec]];\ngbVal = Table[With[{k = Ordering[Abs[ψ], -1][[1]]}, Table[Chop[Expand[(N[gbTn[[a]], gbPrec] . ψ)[[k]]/ψ[[k]]], 10^-40], {a, 3}]], {ψ, gbVec}];\ngbWts = Union[Table[J0[k][p], {p, ps[{gbLam}]}, {k, 3}]];\n(* weight: the GT weight mu minimizing |t1(θ) - Σ z_i mu_i| (h=1) *)\ngbWt = Table[First[MinimalBy[gbWts, Abs[(tt[[1]] /. u -> (θ[1] /. gbPt)) - gbZ . #] &]], {tt, gbVal}];\ngbWtErr = Max[Table[Abs[(gbVal[[A, 1]] /. u -> (θ[1] /. gbPt)) - gbZ . gbWt[[A]]], {A, Length[gbVal]}]];\nToString[{Length[gbVec], N[gbWtErr, 3], Tally[gbWt]}, InputForm]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"50\" data-out-n=\"347\" data-sub-idx=\"11\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"6\" data-sub-start=\"11\" data-sub-end=\"11\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[347]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7InszLCAwJFxncmF2ZXsgfSQkXGdyYXZleyB9JDU4LjU4OTkxMzI4MDAzMzM3LCB7e3syLCAxLCAxfSwgMX0sIHt7MSwgMiwgMX0sIDF9LCB7ezEsIDEsIDJ9LCAxfX19In0=\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8889em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">&quot;</span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">3, 0</span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˋ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord accent\"><span class=\"vlist-t\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"></span></span><span style=\"top:-3em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:3em;\"></span><span class=\"accent-body\" style=\"left:-0.25em;\"><span class=\"mord\">ˋ</span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">58.58991328003337, </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">2, 1, 1</span></span><span class=\"mord\">, 1</span></span><span class=\"mord\">, </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1, 2, 1</span></span><span class=\"mord\">, 1</span></span><span class=\"mord\">, </span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord\">1, 1, 2</span></span><span class=\"mord\">, 1</span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord\">&quot;</span></span></span></span></span></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[347]= \\text{\"{3, 0$\\grave{ }$$\\grave{ }$58.58991328003337, {{{2, 1, 1}, 1}, {{1, 2, 1}, 1}, {{1, 1, 2}, 1}}}\"}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "d198c023-ac37-4695-85b9-649f1d3484df"
    }
