   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Direct and dual Baxter equations (mirror form)",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "gbνn[n_][x_] := gbν[gbLam][n][x] /. gbPt;\n(* direct: Q_i = z_i^(-x/h) q_i; dual: Q^j = z_j^(+x/h) q^j (h=1) *)\ngbOp[\"dir\", tt_, Q_, x_] := gbνn[1][x] gbνn[1][x + 1] gbνn[1][x + 2] Q[x - 1] - (tt[[1]] /. u -> x) gbνn[1][x + 1] gbνn[1][x + 2] Q[x] + (tt[[2]] /. u -> x + 1) gbνn[1][x + 2] Q[x + 1] - (tt[[3]] /. u -> x + 2) Q[x + 2];\ngbOp[\"dual\", tt_, Q_, x_] := gbνn[3][x - 1] gbνn[3][x - 2] gbνn[3][x - 3] Q[x] - (tt[[1]] /. u -> x - 1) gbνn[3][x - 2] gbνn[3][x - 3] Q[x - 1] + (tt[[2]] /. u -> x - 1) gbνn[3][x - 3] Q[x - 2] - (tt[[3]] /. u -> x - 1) Q[x - 3];\n(* monic q of minimal degree <= 6 with Q = zz^(s x) q; {} if none. Identically-zero residual counts as solved. *)\ngbSolve[op_, tt_, zz_, s_] := Module[{c, q, eqs, ns, d, res = {}},\n  Do[If[res === {},\n    q[y_] := Sum[c[j] y^j, {j, 0, d}];\n    eqs = CoefficientList[Chop[Expand[gbOp[op, tt, Function[y, zz^(s y) q[y]], X]/zz^(s X)], 10^-40], X];\n    ns = If[eqs === {}, {UnitVector[d + 1, d + 1]}, NullSpace[N[Table[Coefficient[e, c[j]], {e, eqs}, {j, 0, d}], gbPrec], Tolerance -> 10^-30]];\n    If[Length[ns] > 0, res = Expand[#/Coefficient[#, X, d]] &[Sum[ns[[1, j + 1]] X^j, {j, 0, d}]]]], {d, 0, 6}]; res];\ngbQd = Table[gbSolve[\"dir\", tt, gbZ[[i]], -1], {tt, gbVal}, {i, 3}];\ngbQu = Table[gbSolve[\"dual\", tt, gbZ[[j]], 1], {tt, gbVal}, {j, 3}];\n(* wrong-sign asymptotics as a control: should give nothing *)\ngbCtrl = Union[Flatten[{Table[gbSolve[\"dir\", tt, gbZ[[i]], 1], {tt, gbVal}, {i, 3}], Table[gbSolve[\"dual\", tt, gbZ[[j]], -1], {tt, gbVal}, {j, 3}]}]];\n(* degree rules; the dual one carries -λ3 (found at [2,1,1]; invisible when λ3 = 0) *)\ngbDegOK = {And @@ Flatten[Table[gbQd[[A, i]] =!= {} && Exponent[gbQd[[A, i]], X] == gbLam[[1]] - gbWt[[A, i]], {A, Length[gbVal]}, {i, 3}]],\n   And @@ Flatten[Table[gbQu[[A, j]] =!= {} && Exponent[gbQu[[A, j]], X] == gbWt[[A, j]] - gbLam[[3]], {A, Length[gbVal]}, {j, 3}]]};\nToString[{\"deg q_i = λ1-μ_i, deg q^j = μ_j-λ3:\", gbDegOK, \"wrong-sign control:\", gbCtrl}, InputForm]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"55\" data-out-n=\"387\" data-sub-idx=\"12\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"8\" data-sub-start=\"18\" data-sub-end=\"18\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[387]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7XHtcZGVnIHFcX2kgPSAkXGxhbWJkYSQxLSRcbXUkXF9pLCBkZWcgcVxee31qID0gJFxtdSRcX2otJFxsYW1iZGEkMzpcLCBce1RydWUsIFRydWVcfSwgXHdyb25nLXNpZ24gY29udHJvbDpcLCBce1x9XH19\"><span class=\"wolfbook-render-error\" style=\"color:#cc0000;font-family:monospace;white-space:pre-wrap\">[LaTeX error] KaTeX parse error: Can&#39;t use function &#39;\\deg&#39; in text mode at position 9: \\text{\\{\\̲d̲e̲g̲ ̲q\\_i = $\\lambda…<br><small>\\text{\\{\\deg q\\_i = $\\lambda$1-$\\mu$\\_i, deg q\\^{}j = $\\mu$\\_j-$\\lambda$3:\\, \\{True, True\\}, \\wrong-sign control:\\, \\{\\}\\}}</small></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[387]= \\text{\\{\\deg q\\_i = $\\lambda$1-$\\mu$\\_i, deg q\\^{}j = $\\mu$\\_j-$\\lambda$3:\\, \\{True, True\\}, \\wrong-sign control:\\, \\{\\}\\}}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "0b756367-00ac-4476-9b31-6a386240793a"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## QQ relation\nThe guess is $Q_a(u)Q_b(u+h)-Q_b(u)Q_a(u+h)=(1/z_b-1/z_a)\\,F_\\lambda(u)\\,Q^c(u)$ with $F_\\lambda=\\prod_{n=\\lambda_2+1}^{\\lambda_1}(u-\\theta+nh)$, which for $[3,1,0]$ is $(u-\\theta+2h)(u-\\theta+3h)$. The polynomial parts are compared; the exponentials carry an extra $\\chi_3^{-u/h}$. The cell also reports the roots of the quotient by $q^c$, so a wrong $F$ would show what the actual factor is.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "gbF[x_] := Product[x - θ[1] + n h, {n, gbLam[[2]] + 1, gbLam[[1]]}] /. gbPt;\ngbQQ = Table[Table[Module[{a, b, c, w, quo, rem},\n     {a, b, c} = abc;\n     w = Expand[gbQd[[A, a]] (gbQd[[A, b]] /. X -> X + 1)/gbZ[[b]] - gbQd[[A, b]] (gbQd[[A, a]] /. X -> X + 1)/gbZ[[a]]];\n     {quo, rem} = PolynomialQuotientRemainder[w, gbQu[[A, c]], X];\n     {Max[Abs[CoefficientList[Chop[Expand[w - Coefficient[w, X, Exponent[w, X]] gbF[X] gbQu[[A, c]]], 10^-30], X]], 0],\n      Chop[Coefficient[w, X, Exponent[w, X]]/(1/gbZ[[b]] - 1/gbZ[[a]]), 10^-30],\n      Sort[Chop[N[X - 1/3 /. NSolve[quo == 0, X], 6], 10^-10]]}], {abc, {{1, 2, 3}, {2, 3, 1}, {3, 1, 2}}}], {A, Length[gbVal]}];\nToString[{\"max residual:\", N[Max[gbQQ[[All, All, 1]]], 3], \"C/(1/zb-1/za):\", Union[Round[gbQQ[[All, All, 2]], 10^-8]], \"roots of Q_ab/Q^c in x-θ:\", Union[Round[gbQQ[[All, All, 3]], 10^-4]]}, InputForm]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"56\" data-out-n=\"390\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"10\" data-sub-start=\"8\" data-sub-end=\"8\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[390]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7XHtcbWF4IHJlc2lkdWFsOlwsIDAsIFxDLygxL3piLTEvemEpOlwsIFx7XHsxLCAxLCAxXH1cfSwgIG9vdHMgb2YgUVxfYWIvUVxee31jIGluIHgtJFx0aGV0YSQ6XCwgXHtce1x7LTJcfSwgXHstMlx9LCBcey0yXH1cfVx9XH19\"><span class=\"wolfbook-render-error\" style=\"color:#cc0000;font-family:monospace;white-space:pre-wrap\">[LaTeX error] KaTeX parse error: Can&#39;t use function &#39;\\max&#39; in text mode at position 9: \\text{\\{\\̲m̲a̲x̲ ̲residual:\\, 0, …<br><small>\\text{\\{\\max residual:\\, 0, \\C/(1/zb-1/za):\\, \\{\\{1, 1, 1\\}\\},  oots of Q\\_ab/Q\\^{}c in x-$\\theta$:\\, \\{\\{\\{-2\\}, \\{-2\\}, \\{-2\\}\\}\\}\\}}</small></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[390]= \\text{\\{\\max residual:\\, 0, \\C/(1/zb-1/za):\\, \\{\\{1, 1, 1\\}\\},  oots of Q\\_ab/Q\\^{}c in x-$\\theta$:\\, \\{\\{\\{-2\\}, \\{-2\\}, \\{-2\\}\\}\\}\\}}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
      }
     ],
     "id": "5285751b-ae99-4dcc-9d36-96bdf7a04f37"
    }
   ],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 1,
   "value": "## Wronskian formulas for $t_1,t_2,t_3$ from the dual Q's\n$D_{k_1k_2k_3}(x)=\\det_{j,c}Q^j(x+k_ch)$, with each row's $z_j^{x/h}$ stripped. The formulas are $t_1=\\nu_3(x)D_{1,-1,-2}/D_{0,-1,-2}$, $t_2=\\nu_3(x)\\nu_3(x-h)D_{1,0,-2}/D_{0,-1,-2}$ and $t_3=\\nu_3(x)\\nu_3(x-h)\\nu_3(x-2h)D_{1,0,-1}/D_{0,-1,-2}$.",
   "languageId": "markdown",
   "outputs": [],
   "metadata": {}
  },
  {
   "kind": 2,
   "value": "gbD[qu_, ks_] := Expand[Det[Table[gbZ[[j]]^k (qu[[j]] /. X -> X + k), {j, 3}, {k, ks}]]];\ngbWr = Table[Module[{tt = gbVal[[A]] /. u -> X, qu = gbQu[[A]], d0, d1, d2, d3},\n   d0 = gbD[qu, {0, -1, -2}]; d1 = gbD[qu, {1, -1, -2}]; d2 = gbD[qu, {1, 0, -2}]; d3 = gbD[qu, {1, 0, -1}];\n   {Max[Abs[CoefficientList[Chop[Expand[#], 10^-30], X]], 0] & /@ {d0 tt[[1]] - gbνn[3][X] d1, d0 tt[[2]] - gbνn[3][X] gbνn[3][X - 1] d2, d0 tt[[3]] - gbνn[3][X] gbνn[3][X - 1] gbνn[3][X - 2] d3},\n    Sort[Chop[N[X - 1/3 /. NSolve[d3 == 0, X], 6], 10^-10]]}], {A, Length[gbVal]}];\nToString[{\"max residuals t1,t2,t3:\", N[Max /@ Transpose[gbWr[[All, 1]]], 3], \"roots of D_{1,0,-1} in x-θ:\", Union[Round[gbWr[[All, 2]], 10^-4]]}, InputForm]",
   "languageId": "wolfram",
   "outputs": [
    {
     "items": [
      {
       "data": "<div class=\"wl-output-block\"><div class=\"wl-output-header\" style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;width:100%;min-height:22px;\" data-session-epoch=\"758596\" data-output-id=\"57\" data-out-n=\"393\" data-sub-idx=\"2\" data-output-format=\"WLLatex\" data-output-is-graphics=\"0\" data-cell-idx=\"12\" data-sub-start=\"5\" data-sub-end=\"5\"><span style=\"font-size:10px;color:#888;margin-right:8px;\">Out[393]=</span></div><div class=\"wl-output-content\"><div class=\"vscode-wolfram-wllatex-prerendered\" data-page-width-em=\"21\" data-latex-b64=\"XHRleHR7XHtcbWF4IHJlc2lkdWFscyB0MSx0Mix0MzpcLCBcezAsIDAsIDBcfSwgIG9vdHMgb2YgRFxfXHsxLDAsLTFcfSBpbiB4LSRcdGhldGEkOlwsIFx7XHstMlx9XH1cfX0=\"><span class=\"wolfbook-render-error\" style=\"color:#cc0000;font-family:monospace;white-space:pre-wrap\">[LaTeX error] KaTeX parse error: Can&#39;t use function &#39;\\max&#39; in text mode at position 9: \\text{\\{\\̲m̲a̲x̲ ̲residuals t1,t2…<br><small>\\text{\\{\\max residuals t1,t2,t3:\\, \\{0, 0, 0\\},  oots of D\\_\\{1,0,-1\\} in x-$\\theta$:\\, \\{\\{-2\\}\\}\\}}</small></span></div></div></div>",
       "mime": "x-application/wolfram-language-html"
      },
      {
       "data": "Out[393]= \\text{\\{\\max residuals t1,t2,t3:\\, \\{0, 0, 0\\},  oots of D\\_\\{1,0,-1\\} in x-$\\theta$:\\, \\{\\{-2\\}\\}\\}}",
       "mime": "text/plain"
